"Add a picture or a video of who speaks, write the take's words as the spoken line in step 3, and describe the same voice in the line's Voice box.": "加入說話者的圖片或影片，在步驟 3 把這個鏡次的台詞寫成對白，並在該行的「聲音」欄描述相同的聲音。",
