"Adds a provider sign-in to Hermes' own credential pool.": "在 Hermes 本身的憑證池中新增一個供應商登入。",
"Aerial": "空拍",
"Aerial Approach": "空拍接近",
"After a Sharp Spec clip renders, his QA gate checks it: the spoken line by its transcript, then three frames by a vision model (Claude Code, Codex or a local model, under your own sign-in). A clip that fails is made once more at the next seed.": "Sharp Spec 片段算圖完成後，他的 QA 關卡會檢查：先用逐字稿核對台詞，再用視覺模型（Claude Code、Codex 或本機模型，使用你自己的登入）檢查三張影格。未通過的片段會用下一個種子再做一次。",
