"Changes one thing in the clip from a sentence, in three steps. 1: the clip’s first frame is redrawn by the picture model from your words. 2: Motion Previs reads the clip’s motion as a depth layer. 3: the clip is made again from the depth layer and the redrawn frame, so the motion and camera are the clip’s and the look the new frame’s. There is no mask: the whole frame is redrawn from the instruction, so other small details can change too. At most 15 seconds; needs MiniMax H3 Ref2VA, Motion Previs and a picture model.": "用一句話修改片段中的一處，分三步驟。1：圖片模型依你的文字重繪片段的首影格。2：Motion Previs 將片段的動作讀取為深度圖層。3：以深度圖層和重繪的影格重新製作片段，因此動作與運鏡來自原片段，風格來自新影格。沒有遮罩：整個畫面都會依指示重繪，其他小細節也可能改變。最長 15 秒；需要 MiniMax H3 Ref2VA、Motion Previs 和圖片模型。",
