"EWS": "EWS",
"Each LoRA is its author's work, under that file's own licence; the page named on a card is where it comes from and who to credit. Install takes the file from the LoRA bundle on this machine when there is one (no network), and otherwise from the author's page, and checks it.": "每個 LoRA 都是作者的作品，適用該檔案自己的授權；卡片上列出的頁面就是來源及應標示的作者。安裝時若這台機器上有 LoRA 套件，會從套件取得檔案（不需網路），否則從作者頁面下載，並進行檢查。",
"Each LoRA on this machine is a button under the hub's name: a click picks it (✓) and another click drops it. To install one, open “▸ Browse the hub” and press “⤓ Install” on its card: it shows the licence first, then takes the file from a LoRA bundle on this machine or from its author's page.": "這台機器上的每個 LoRA 都是 LoRA 中心 名稱下的一個按鈕：點一下選取（✓），再點一下取消。要安裝時，開啟「▸ 瀏覽 LoRA 中心」並在卡片上按「⤓ 安裝」：會先顯示授權，再從這台機器上的 LoRA 套件或作者頁面取得檔案。",
"Each angle is one picture from one load of the model. The LoRA was trained on single objects and characters: a side or back view often comes back on a plain studio background.": "每個角度都是模型載入一次產生的一張圖片。這個 LoRA 是用單一物件與角色訓練的：側面或背面常會出現在素色攝影棚背景上。",
"Each card says what the LoRA does, who made it, what it works from, its licence and its size. “⤓ Install” puts it on this machine; “Use on this clip” adds it to the clip you are making, with its trigger word written into the prompt for you. A LoRA for pictures says “Use in Edit a picture”; one that drives a Library action says “Open the Library”.": "每張卡片會說明 LoRA 的功能、作者、輸入來源、授權與大小。「⤓ 安裝」會把它裝到這台機器；「用在這個片段」會把它加到你正在製作的片段，並替你把觸發詞寫進提示詞。圖片用的 LoRA 會顯示「用於編輯圖片」；驅動素材庫動作的則顯示「開啟素材庫」。",
"Each clip of 15 s or less gets its sound made for its picture (MMAudio) before the cut. Slower.": "15 秒以內的片段會在剪接前依畫面生成聲音（MMAudio）。速度較慢。",
"Each clip waits for the one before, so a long video renders on this machine alone, whatever the Sparks setting says.": "每個片段都要等前一個完成，因此長影片只會在這台機器上算圖，不論 Spark 設定為何。",
"Each edit moves the seed on by one, so pressing again gives another take of the same words; type a seed to repeat one.": "每次編輯種子都會加一，所以再按一次會得到同一段文字的另一個鏡次；輸入種子即可重現。",
"Each engine's licence line shows under the picker, and each take says which engine made it. “Again, next seed” keeps the take's engine.": "每個引擎的授權說明會顯示在選擇器下方，每個鏡次也會標示由哪個引擎製作。「再來一次，下一個種子」會沿用該鏡次的引擎。",
"Each feature counts as one point. Its recipes share that point equally; missing features remain in the total.": "每項功能算一分，其配方平分這一分；缺少的功能仍計入總分。",
"Each look is its author's work under its own licence; the page on its card says where it comes from and who to credit.": "每個風格都是作者依其授權條款發布的作品；卡片上的頁面會說明出處與署名方式。",
"Each machine": "每台機器",
"Each model server you run is an agent of its own, beside your subscriptions.": "你執行的每個模型伺服器都是獨立的助理，與你的訂閱並列。",
"Each opens the full form with sensible settings.": "每個都會以合適的設定開啟完整表單。",
"Each remote Spark runs its own copy of this Studio, closed to the network: this app reaches it through an ssh tunnel it opens itself, so you need a key login to it as the user who runs this app.": "每台遠端 Spark 都執行自己的一份 Studio，且不對網路開放：這個應用程式會自行開啟 ssh 通道連過去，所以你需要以執行本應用程式的使用者身分設定金鑰登入。",
"Each render comes back on its shot as a take, in Shots and in Deliver. Under every clip is a box for notes: what to keep and what to fix. “↻ Regenerate” queues a new take of that shot.": "每次算圖都會以鏡次的形式回到對應鏡頭，顯示在「鏡頭」與「交付」中。每個片段下方都有備註欄：要保留什麼、要修正什麼。「↻ 重新生成」會為該鏡頭排入新的鏡次。",
"Each row shows whether the Spark answers, its Studio's version, memory and disk free, what it can render and whether it is busy. “Check” only looks. “Update and start” sends this Spark's Studio code (not the models) and starts its app. “Stop” frees its memory. Untick “use” to keep it in the list without giving it clips.": "每一列顯示 Spark 是否回應、其 Studio 版本、可用記憶體與磁碟空間、能算圖的項目以及是否忙碌。「檢查」只會查看。「更新並啟動」會傳送這台 Spark 的 Studio 程式碼（不含模型）並啟動其程式。「停止」會釋放其記憶體。取消勾選「使用」可保留在清單中但不分派片段。",
"Each shot has specs (seconds, size, angle, lens, movement) and a prompt in six sections: Subject, Composition, Lighting, Camera, Style, Mood. ✦ Structure, Tighten, Enrich and the rest rewrite it; a Director's note changes it in plain words; the old version goes to History.": "每個鏡頭都有規格（秒數、尺寸、角度、焦段、運動）以及分成六段的提示詞：主體、構圖、光線、攝影機、風格、氛圍。✦ 結構化、精簡、豐富化等功能會改寫它；導演備註以白話修改它；舊版本會存到歷史紀錄。",
"Each shot opens in Create with its words, frames and motion in place.": "每個鏡頭都會在 Create 中開啟，文字、影格與動態都已就位。",
"Each shot's own length": "每個鏡頭各自的長度",
"Each step is": "每個步驟為",
"Each take is a job in the queue. The model loads on the first take (about 5 s on a Mac, 18 s on a Spark), stays loaded for five idle minutes, and is unloaded at once when a video or picture job starts.": "每個鏡次都是佇列中的一個工作。模型在第一個鏡次時載入（Mac 約 5 秒，Spark 約 18 秒），閒置五分鐘內保持載入，影片或圖片工作開始時會立刻卸載。",
"Each view is a picture of its own in the Library: “first frame” starts a clip on it, “reference” adds it to a reference clip's pictures. 512 is the fastest size; 1024 is the one to keep.": "每個視角都是素材庫中獨立的一張圖片：「首影格」以它作為片段開頭，「參考」把它加入參考片段的圖片中。512 是最快的尺寸；1024 適合保留。",
