"Elevate the camera above the subject's eyeline looking down, keeping the same subject distance as the other angles for a clean set.": "攝影機升到主體視線上方向下拍，與其他角度保持相同的主體距離，讓整組鏡頭一致。",
"Emotional range": "情緒幅度",
"Empty every prompt field of this clip: scene, action, camera, lines, sound, and the composed prompt. Pictures, clips and settings stay.": "清空這個片段的所有提示詞欄位：場景、動作、攝影機、台詞、聲音與組合後的提示詞。圖片、片段與設定會保留。",
"Empty the scene, action, voice, line and soundscape of every segment. Titles, lengths and rendered clips stay.": "清空所有段落的場景、動作、聲音、台詞與環境音景。標題、長度與已算圖的片段會保留。",
