"Erases the files in the trash folder for good": "永久清除垃圾桶資料夾中的檔案",
"Escalation": "升級",
"Escape": "Escape",
"Establish blocking, spatial relationships, and full performance for the scene as a safety and editorial spine.": "建立場景的走位、空間關係與完整表演，作為保險鏡頭與剪輯骨幹。",
"Establish location B as the parallel counterpart to A, ready to be intercut against it.": "建立地點 B，作為與 A 平行的對照，準備與 A 交叉剪接。",
"Establish the clinical, watched feeling of a fixed overhead security perspective.": "建立固定俯視監視視角那種冷冽、被監看的感覺。",
"Establish the geography and stakes of location A before crosscutting begins.": "在交叉剪接開始前，建立地點 A 的地理位置與利害關係。",
"Establish the geography of the conversation and give the editor a wide safety to return to.": "建立對話的地理位置，並給剪輯師一個可隨時切回的廣角保險鏡頭。",
"Establish the scene's normal world and status quo before disruption.": "在干擾發生前，建立場景的日常世界與現狀。",
"Establishing Sequence": "開場建立段落",
"Estimate": "預估",
"Estimate: about": "預估：約",
"Estimated from measured peaks; the server is stopped if the machine runs low all the same.": "依實測峰值估算；若機器記憶體仍然不足，伺服器會停止。",
"Ethnicity": "族裔",
"Euphoria": "狂喜",
"Every clip, scout, image and export the app has made, as files under": "程式製作的所有片段、勘景圖、圖片與成品，存放於",
"Every credit": "全部致謝",
"Every finished or cancelled job leaves this list and its clips, stills and check sheets go to the trash folder. A clip that is in a film (a project's timeline, a Slate take) stays.": "所有已完成或已取消的工作都會離開此清單，其片段、靜態圖與檢查表會移到垃圾桶資料夾。已用在影片中的片段（專案時間軸、場記板鏡次）會保留。",
"Every form has a Clear button: “Clear this step” and “Clear all” at the foot of the create wizard, “Clear” on a segment and “Clear every segment's text” on the production board, “Clear” above a Slate shot's prompt, and “Clear” in the Voice and Music tabs. It empties the text only; pictures, clips, titles and settings stay.": "每個表單都有清除按鈕：建立精靈底部的「清除此步驟」與「全部清除」、製作看板上段落的「清除」與「清除所有段落的文字」、場記板鏡頭提示詞上方的「清除」，以及「配音」與「音樂」分頁中的「清除」。它只會清空文字；圖片、片段、標題與設定會保留。",
"Every further picture makes the edit slower. On a Mac, FLUX3-K Full is slow for edits (240 s for one picture on an M5 Ultra); use FLUX3-K Fast there.": "每多一張圖片，編輯就會更慢。在 Mac 上 FLUX3-K Full 編輯很慢（M5 Ultra 上一張圖 240 秒）；請改用 FLUX3-K Fast。",
"Every light in the city went out at once": "城裡的燈在同一刻全部熄滅",
"Every look": "所有風格",
"Every prompt field of this clip is empty.": "這個片段的所有提示詞欄位都是空的。",
"Every room is in the sidebar again.": "每個房間都已重新回到側邊欄。",
"Every shot from text or cast stills takes up to two pinned pictures of each person in it and two of its place as reference pictures (nine in all, the cast first). Shots from the shot before or an image keep the descriptions in words. A LoRA on a sheet goes on every shot with that person or place.": "每個從文字或演員靜態圖開始的鏡頭，會取用其中每個人最多兩張釘選圖片，以及其場景兩張，作為參考圖（總共九張，演員優先）。從上一個鏡頭或圖片開始的鏡頭則以文字保留描述。設定表上的 LoRA 會套用在每個有該人物或場景的鏡頭。",
"Every shot of": "以下影片的每個鏡頭：",
"Every shot with a prompt already has a take": "每個有提示詞的鏡頭都已有鏡次",
"Every shot with a prompt and no good take is rendered overnight, then a reel, the dailies and notes are made": "所有有提示詞但還沒有好鏡次的鏡頭都會在夜間算圖，接著製作剪輯、毛片與筆記",
"Every take on this machine": "這台機器上的所有鏡次",
"Every take, with its prompt and seed": "每個鏡次，連同提示詞與種子",
"Every tool of a hosted AI studio, and more, on your own machine. Each app opens the Studio's own form with the model and settings chosen.": "託管 AI 工作室的所有工具，甚至更多，都在你自己的機器上。每個應用程式都會開啟 Studio 本身的表單，並選好模型與設定。",
"Everyone whose work made the studio possible, as CREDITS.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the repo say it.": "所有讓工作室得以實現的人，依 repo 中 CREDITS.md 與 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 所載。",
"Everything else in the studio folder": "studio 資料夾中的其他所有內容",
"Everything here is in the Library too": "這裡的所有內容也都在素材庫中",
"Everything you make is saved as you go in the film's own folder, in Slate's project format.": "你製作的所有內容都會即時儲存在該影片自己的資料夾，採用場記板的專案格式。",
"Everything you queue from any tab lands in the render bay along the bottom and runs in order: clips, pictures, edits, Library actions, voice takes and songs. You can keep working and queue more while a job runs.": "從任何分頁排入的工作都會進入底部的算圖區並依序執行：片段、圖片、編輯、素材庫動作、配音鏡次與歌曲。工作執行時你可以繼續操作並排入更多工作。",
"Example": "範例",
"Example loaded into Create": "範例已載入「建立」",
"Exclusive weight files only; previews files and requires confirmation. Stop Studio first. Shared files and runtime environments are kept.": "僅限專屬權重檔；會先預覽檔案並要求確認。請先停止工作室。共用檔案與執行環境會保留。",
"Existing CUDA admission based on Spark observations plus reserve; not a Windows minimum-RAM measurement.": "既有 CUDA 准入，依 Spark 觀測值另加保留量；不是 Windows 最低記憶體量測。",
"Existing CUDA admission: measured Spark peak about 41.6 GiB plus engine reserve; not a Windows minimum-RAM measurement.": "既有 CUDA 准入：Spark 實測峰值約 41.6 GiB，另加引擎保留量；不是 Windows 最低記憶體量測。",
"Existing CUDA recipe admission including runtime state and reserve; not a Windows minimum-RAM measurement.": "既有 CUDA 配方准入，含執行狀態與保留量；不是 Windows 最低記憶體量測。",
