"FLUX3-K base model": "FLUX3-K 基礎模型",
"FLUX3-K first writes a full scene description from your prompt (5 to 20 s, once for all the images), so a short prompt is enough. The models have licences of their own (Qwen Research License, FLUX Kommunity License; MOSS-Image is Apache 2.0): read them before commercial use.": "FLUX3-K 會先根據你的提示詞寫出完整場景描述（5 到 20 秒，所有圖片共用一次），所以簡短的提示詞就夠了。這些模型各有授權（Qwen Research License、FLUX Kommunity License；MOSS-Image 為 Apache 2.0）：商業使用前請先閱讀。",
