"FLUX3-K writes a full scene description from your prompt first, then makes each image. Feature checks show this backend's memory requirements and measurement source": "FLUX3-K 會先根據你的提示詞寫出完整場景描述，再製作每張圖片。功能檢查會顯示此後端的記憶體需求與量測來源",
