"For": "用於",
"For LoRAs, camera angles or several pictures use Create › Edit a picture.": "要用 LoRA、鏡頭角度或多張圖片，請用「建立 › 編輯圖片」。",
"For a first clip leave it on “Video with sound” and pick “Text only”. The model then invents the whole picture from your words.": "第一個片段請維持「有聲影片」並選「僅文字」。模型會根據你的文字構想整個畫面。",
"For a new place, depth is the better choice.": "新地點的話，深度是較好的選擇。",
"For a tool, or to type on a device: kept in": "給工具用或要在裝置上輸入：存放在",
"For clips from Home and a new Create": "用於首頁的片段與新的建立",
"For running, sport, dance, tumbling, fights. About 0.9 alone; 0.5 to 0.7 beside Combat Base V2. Too high can rebuild the whole movement or change the sound. The trigger word is optional.": "適合奔跑、運動、舞蹈、翻滾、打鬥。單獨使用約 0.9；搭配 Combat Base V2 時 0.5 到 0.7。太高可能重建整段動作或改變聲音。觸發詞可省略。",
"For stills and scouts": "用於靜態圖與勘景",
"For the Music tab: best here is YuE2 where it is installed (Linux, NVIDIA) and MiniMax Music 3 on a Mac; each song can still choose": "用於音樂分頁：這裡最佳的是已安裝的 YuE2（Linux、NVIDIA），Mac 上則是 MiniMax Music 3；每首歌仍可自行選擇",
"For the same place with a new person send the reference clip. For a new place send AI depth with a picture of the opening frame: depth kept the moves nearly as well in our tests.": "同一地點換人時，送出參考片段。新地點時，送出 AI 深度並附上開場影格的圖片：在我們的測試中，深度保留動作的效果幾乎一樣好。",
"Foreground Anchor": "前景錨點",
"Foreground Bokeh Elements": "前景散景元素",
"Foreground character B's shoulder and ear soft in frame; keep character A's eyeline consistent with the master for clean matched cutting.": "角色 B 的肩膀與耳朵在前景失焦；角色 A 的視線方向與主鏡頭一致，方便乾淨地匹配剪接。",
