"Found at": "已找到：",
"Fountain or Final Draft scripts, a ScriptBreak project, Cork Board or Master Canvas JSON, a Master Canvas hand-off, a Storyboard Reference export or a Blockout package (.zip), or a Slate project.json.": "Fountain 或 Final Draft 劇本、ScriptBreak 專案、Cork Board 或 Master Canvas JSON、Master Canvas 交接包、Storyboard Reference 匯出或 Blockout 套件（.zip），或場記板 project.json。",
"Fountain or suite exports; convert Final Draft to Fountain first": "Fountain 或套件匯出檔；Final Draft 請先轉成 Fountain",
"Fountain or suite exports; no model required": "Fountain 或套件匯出檔；不需要模型",
"Fountain screenplay": "Fountain 劇本",
"Four candidates, pick one, then the clip.": "四張候選圖，選一張，再生成片段。",
"Four heights": "四種高度",
"Fragrance": "香氛",
"Frame Within Frame": "框中框",
"Frame a monitor or screen displaying the surveillance feed, with scan lines, timestamp, or screen glow visible in the shot.": "框入顯示監視畫面的螢幕，畫面中可見掃描線、時間戳或螢幕光。",
"Frame a shared reference point, such as a countdown display or communication device, that could belong to either thread.": "框入一個共同的參照點，例如倒數顯示器或通訊裝置，可以屬於任一條故事線。",
"Frame every performer in the scene with headroom and blocking space; keep the camera locked off so this shot can carry any dialogue beat in the edit.": "框入場景中的每位演員，留足頭頂空間與走位空間；攝影機固定不動，讓這個鏡頭在剪輯時能承接任何對白節拍。",
"Frame the dancer fully from head to feet with room to move in every direction; keep the camera locked so the full performance reads clearly.": "從頭到腳完整框入舞者，四面都留有活動空間；攝影機固定，讓完整表演清楚呈現。",
"Frame the doorway centered with the character emerging from shadow or backlight into visibility; hold the reveal a beat before movement.": "門口置中，角色從陰影或逆光中走出、逐漸顯露；揭示後停留一拍再開始動作。",
"Frame the landmark centered and fully visible, with enough surrounding context to confirm location and time of day.": "地標置中且完整可見，周圍保留足夠環境以確認地點與時間。",
"Frame the opposing characters or character-and-obstacle together in the same shot to establish direct confrontation.": "把對立的角色，或角色與障礙，框在同一個鏡頭中，建立正面衝突。",
"Frame the subject partially blocked by foreground elements like blinds, foliage, or a doorframe, as if glimpsed rather than shown.": "主體被百葉窗、枝葉或門框等前景部分遮擋，像是被瞥見而非被呈現。",
"Frame tight from collarbone up; keep focus critically sharp on the eyes for this character's key dialogue moment.": "從鎖骨以上緊湊構圖；焦點精準落在眼睛，用於這個角色的關鍵台詞時刻。",
"Frame tight on the point of contact at the instant of impact; the composition should read as a single decisive beat.": "在衝擊瞬間緊貼接觸點構圖；構圖應讀成一個果斷的節拍。",
"Frames per second": "每秒影格數",
"From": "來自",
"From a Mac only single FastH3 clips a Spark makes with its own settings go to a Spark (no MiniMax H3 Turbo quality, no 2x decoder preset, no text encoder file of this Mac's); the rest renders on this Mac, and the page says why. A Spark this Mac cannot reach goes through one that can (“Through”): that Spark logs in to it with its own key.": "從 Mac 只會把 Spark 能用自身設定生成的單一 FastH3 片段交給 Spark（不含 MiniMax H3 Turbo 畫質、2x 解碼器預設，以及這台 Mac 的文字編碼器檔案）；其餘在這台 Mac 上算圖，頁面會說明原因。這台 Mac 連不到的 Spark 會透過一台連得到的 Spark 轉接（「經由」）：由那台 Spark 用自己的金鑰登入。",
"From a clip in the Library": "從素材庫中的片段",
"From a link": "從連結",
"From our 128-picture test: Qwen 2.1 Turbo for drafts, FLUX3-K Fast as the everyday choice, Qwen 2.1 Full for faces, posters and character sheets, FLUX3-K Full for final frames of busy scenes and hands; on a DGX Spark, MOSS-Image for anything with words in the frame. The same choice is offered for scouts and a last frame.": "根據我們 128 張圖片的測試：草稿用 Qwen 2.1 Turbo，日常用 FLUX3-K Fast，臉孔、海報與角色設定表用 Qwen 2.1 Full，繁忙場景與手部的最終畫面用 FLUX3-K Full；在 DGX Spark 上，畫面中有文字的都用 MOSS-Image。勘景圖與尾影格也提供相同選項。",
"From the logline the Director writes what the film still needs (cast, places, scenes, shots with their lines), makes a reference picture and a turnaround of each character and a plate of each place, renders every shot in order, checks each take and takes a failed one again, and cuts the takes that passed together. A take that fails stays in the Library, out of the cut unless you circle it. It keeps what is already there.": "導演會依一句話故事寫出影片還缺的部分（角色、場景、場次、含台詞的鏡頭），為每個角色製作參考圖與轉面圖、為每個場景製作背景板，依序算出每個鏡頭，檢查每個鏡次並重拍失敗的鏡次，再把通過的鏡次剪在一起。失敗的鏡次會留在素材庫，除非你圈選，否則不會剪進去。已有的內容都會保留。",
"From the repository's own documentation.": "出自該儲存庫自己的文件。",
"From the suite": "來自套件",
"From your picture": "從你的圖片",
"Front": "正面",
