"Give the same picture as the first and the last frame (step 2, 'Same as the first frame') and use the author's prompt as it is. Author's settings: 768x768, 73 frames, 28 passes, strength 1.0, no sound. It also orbited here at the Studio's usual passes.": "把同一張圖片同時設為首影格與尾影格（步驟 2，「與首影格相同」），並直接使用作者的提示詞。作者設定：768x768、73 影格、28 步、強度 1.0、無聲音。在這裡用工作室平常的步數也能環繞。",
