"Grades a finished clip very bright and contrasty and writes it as real HDR: BT.2020, HLG, 10-bit HEVC. The clip’s own sound stays. It runs on the processor with no model, so it adds no detail. To finish a cut, finish the joined film as one clip, so the look does not jump at the cuts. Only an HDR screen shows the master’s full range: the SDR copy keeps the look on any other.": "把完成的片段調成非常明亮、高對比，並輸出為真正的 HDR：BT.2020、HLG、10-bit HEVC。片段原本的聲音保留。這在處理器上執行、不使用模型，因此不會增加細節。要完成整部剪輯時，請把接好的影片當成一個片段來完成，風格才不會在剪接點跳動。只有 HDR 螢幕能顯示母帶的完整範圍：SDR 版本讓其他螢幕也保有這個風格。",
