"Guidance distilled from the official Dreamina Seedance 2.5 Prompt Guide (ByteDance Feishu doc, updated 2026-07-31). References: up to 30 images (≤4K), 10 videos (≤30s combined), 10 audio clips (≤30s combined); recommended 1-8 distinct subjects. Also supports video editing (source video is the sole editing master; aspect/duration auto-locked), forward/backward extension (align the boundary frame first), first/last-frame + multi-keyframe control, storyboard grids (≤15 panels), coarse/fine blockout re-rendering (pairs with Blockout exports), one-click video, and seamless transitions. Max prompt length and fps still unpublished.": "整理自官方 Dreamina Seedance 2.5 提示詞指南（ByteDance 飛書文件，2026-07-31 更新）。參考素材：最多 30 張圖片（≤4K）、10 段影片（合計 ≤30 秒）、10 段音訊（合計 ≤30 秒）；建議 1-8 個不同主體。另支援影片編輯（來源影片是唯一的編輯母帶；比例與長度自動鎖定）、向前／向後延伸（先對齊邊界影格）、首尾影格＋多關鍵影格控制、分鏡格（≤15 格）、粗略／精細 blockout 重新算圖（搭配 Blockout 匯出）、一鍵成片與無縫轉場。最大提示詞長度與 fps 仍未公開。",
