"If a workflow only accepts one control movie, start with ai_depth.mp4 when present, otherwise depth.mp4, then test pose_high_contrast.mp4.": "如果工作流程只接受一個控制影片，有 ai_depth.mp4 就先用它，否則用 depth.mp4，再試 pose_high_contrast.mp4。",
"If the key got out, or a device you signed in is gone: every other browser and phone is signed out and asks again. This browser stays signed in.": "如果金鑰外流，或你登入過的裝置遺失：其他所有瀏覽器與手機都會被登出並需重新登入。這個瀏覽器會保持登入。",
"If the shot check fails (a keyframe not held, or a cut inside the shot), render it once more at the next seed. That is a second full render.": "若鏡頭檢查未通過（關鍵影格沒有保持，或鏡頭內有剪接），會用下一個種子再算一次。這等於再做一次完整算圖。",
"If you go back and change the boxes in step 1 or 3 afterwards, press “Rebuild from steps 1–3”. Otherwise the old prompt is rendered. Rebuild throws away hand edits.": "如果之後回去修改步驟 1 或 3 的欄位，請按「從步驟 1–3 重建」，否則會算圖舊的提示詞。重建會捨棄手動修改。",
