"Imagination Studio ·": "Imagination Studio ·",
"Imagination Studio: Home": "Imagination Studio：首頁",
"Impact Frame": "衝擊畫面",
"Impacts": "打擊",
"Impacts over a slow reference leaves the video out and lets the picture and the prompt carry the fight; the camera move stays, in words. Flow takes the hits out of the soundscape, and without music the clip is delivered silent.": "在緩慢的參考上用打擊，會捨棄影片，讓圖片和提示詞撐起打鬥；運鏡仍以文字保留。流動會把打擊聲從環境音景中移除，若沒有音樂，片段會以無聲交付。",
"Impacts: the prompt says that the arms attack and block at full speed and that every strike is heard as it lands.": "打擊：提示詞說明手臂全速攻擊與格擋，每一擊落下時都聽得到聲音。",
"Imperfect Focus Realism": "不完美對焦寫實",
"Import": "匯入",
"Import a take rendered on another machine": "匯入在另一台機器上算圖的鏡次",
"Import the take": "匯入鏡次",
"Imported a take of": "已匯入鏡次：",
"Imported clip": "匯入的片段",
"Imported film": "匯入的影片",
"Improves reproducibility but is explicitly documented as not guaranteeing determinism.": "可提高重現性，但文件明確註明不保證結果一致。",
"In (s)": "入點（秒）",
"In Blender, build a rain-soaked parking garage at night with sodium lights. Put a camera at eye level with a 35 mm lens looking down the row, and render a 1344×768 still.": "在 Blender 中建一座夜晚、被雨淋濕、打著鈉燈的停車場。把攝影機放在視線高度，用 35 mm 鏡頭沿著車列望去，算出一張 1344×768 的靜態圖。",
"In Blender, import the attached model, light it with a three-point setup and render a 24-frame turntable as stills.": "在 Blender 中匯入附加的模型，用三點打光，並算出 24 影格的轉台靜態圖。",
"In Blockout, stage one actor walking to a car, stopping and turning. Add a slow push-in on a 35 mm lens over 8 seconds, then export the motion package.": "在 Blockout 中安排一名演員走向汽車、停下並轉身。加上 35 mm 鏡頭 8 秒的緩慢推鏡，然後匯出動作包。",
"In Casting, pin a still to a character (upload one, or have the image model make candidates from the sheet). That still is how the face stays the same from shot to shot.": "在「選角」中，為角色釘選一張定裝照（上傳一張，或讓圖片模型根據設定表產生候選）。靠這張定裝照，臉孔才能在各鏡頭間保持一致。",
"In Deliver press “Send the film's takes to the Timeline (Edit)”. The circled takes land on the timeline in story order. In the Timeline (Edit), trim with In and Out, press “▶ Play the sequence” to watch the film, pick the size and press “Export”. “Download the export” is your finished video.": "在「交付」中按「把影片的鏡次送到時間軸（剪輯）」。圈選的鏡次會依故事順序放上時間軸。在時間軸（剪輯）中以入點與出點修剪，按「▶ 播放序列」觀看影片，選擇尺寸後按「匯出」。「下載成品」就是你完成的影片。",
"In Settings → Access key press Show (or Copy) and type the key on the device when the studio asks: “Sign this device in”. In a terminal on the computer, bash scripts/studio-key.sh prints it too.": "在「設定 → 存取金鑰」按「顯示」（或「複製」），並在裝置詢問「登入這台裝置」時輸入金鑰。也可以在電腦的終端機執行 bash scripts/studio-key.sh 顯示金鑰。",
"In Slate's Sound tab a voice sheet has “Cast voice”: Fish Audio Drama 3 speaks the sheet's sample line in the voice the sheet describes, on this machine. The take is kept on the sheet.": "在場記板的「聲音」分頁中，聲音設定表有「為聲音選角」：Fish Audio Drama 3 會在這台機器上，用設定表描述的聲音念出設定表的範例台詞。鏡次會保留在設定表上。",
"In Slate, a voice sheet's “Cast voice” uses the same engine for a film's cast.": "在場記板中，聲音設定表的「為聲音選角」會用相同引擎處理影片的演員陣容。",
"In Studios, open Casting. For each character press “Make reference pictures from the sheet” or upload a still, and keep the one you like. In a shot, choose “Cast stills” as what it opens on and tick who is in it: the face then comes from the still.": "在「工作室」中開啟「選角」。為每個角色按「根據設定表製作參考圖」或上傳定裝照，並保留你喜歡的那張。在鏡頭中選擇「角色定裝照」作為開場，並勾選出場人物：臉孔就會來自定裝照。",
"In a terminal instead:": "改用終端機：",
"In and Out are seconds within the clip. In 0.5 skips the first half second; Out 4 stops at four seconds. Out left at 0 plays the clip to its end.": "入點與出點是片段內的秒數。入點 0.5 會略過前半秒；出點 4 會在第四秒停止。出點保留為 0 會播到片段結尾。",
"In place of it": "取代原聲",
"In step 2 add up to": "在步驟 2 最多加入",
"In step 3 press “+ Add a line”. Voice describes how the speaker sounds; Line is the exact words. The words go into the prompt unchanged.": "在步驟 3 按「+ 加入台詞」。「聲音」描述說話者的聲音；「台詞」是確切的文字。文字會原封不動放進提示詞。",
"In the Bible, under “How this film renders”, pick the resolution and quality for every shot. “Wasserman Sharp Spec” sets Sam Wasserman's locked recipe and runs his QA gate on each clip. The Keys and Wasserman LoRA Hub below it gives the whole film one look, for example the 80s horror LoRA.": "在設定集的「這部影片如何算圖」下，為所有鏡頭選擇解析度與畫質。「Wasserman Sharp Spec」會套用 Sam Wasserman 的鎖定配方，並對每個片段執行他的 QA 關卡。下方的 Keys and Wasserman LoRA 中心 能讓整部影片統一風格，例如 80 年代恐怖片 LoRA。",
"In the Library": "在素材庫中",
"In the Sparks tab, under “Add a DGX Spark”, type its address as you would after ssh and press “Add”. The other Spark needs the Studio installed once (oneshot-setup-spark.sh) and a key login from this one: no password is asked, and nothing runs as root.": "在「Spark」分頁的「新增 DGX Spark」下，輸入它的位址（就像 ssh 後面接的那樣）並按「新增」。另一台 Spark 需要先安裝一次 Studio（oneshot-setup-spark.sh），並允許從這台以金鑰登入：不需輸入密碼，也不會以 root 執行任何東西。",
"In the Sparks tab, under “Add a Spark”, type its address as you would after ssh and press “Add”. The other Spark needs the Studio installed once (oneshot-setup-spark.sh) and a key login from this one: no password is asked, and nothing runs as root.": "在「Spark」分頁的「新增 Spark」下，輸入它的位址（就像 ssh 後面接的那樣）並按「新增」。另一台 Spark 需要先安裝一次 Studio（oneshot-setup-spark.sh），並允許從這台以金鑰登入：不需輸入密碼，也不會以 root 執行任何東西。",
"In the queue": "在佇列中",
"In the wizard's step 2 the motion is": "在精靈的步驟 2，動作為",
"In “▸ Browse the hub”, “+ Add your own LoRA” opens a recipe form: a name, the download address of the .safetensors file or an uploaded file, the trigger word, the strength, and optional looks written as name = phrase. “Add to the hub” makes it a button on this machine, next to the presets.": "在「▸ 瀏覽 LoRA 中心」中，「+ 加入自己的 LoRA」會開啟配方表單：名稱、.safetensors 檔案的下載網址或上傳的檔案、觸發詞、強度，以及以「名稱 = 片語」寫成的選填風格。「加入 LoRA 中心」會讓它成為這台機器上的按鈕，與預設並列。",
"In-app updates need a GitHub installation with an HTTPS or SSH origin.": "應用程式內更新需要 GitHub 安裝，且 origin 為 HTTPS 或 SSH。",
