"Isolate a physical detail of the motion itself, such as feet, wheels, or hands, for texture and rhythm.": "孤立出動作本身的肢體細節，例如腳、車輪或手，增加質感與節奏。",
"Isolate the percussive detail of footwork or hand gesture that drives the piece's rhythm.": "孤立出驅動作品節奏的步伐或手勢細節。",
"Isolate the scene's focal character in a clean, uncluttered frame for their key line or beat.": "在乾淨、不雜亂的畫面中孤立出場景的焦點角色，用於其關鍵台詞或節拍。",
"Isolation": "孤立",
"It did not come back.": "沒有回來。",
"It does not fit the selected worker's available memory.": "超出所選工作節點的可用記憶體。",
"It is": "它是",
"It is a LoRA for pictures, not for a clip. It works in Edit a picture.": "這是圖片用的 LoRA，不是片段用的。請在「編輯圖片」中使用。",
"It is a reference already": "它已經是參考了",
"It is answering now": "現在有回應了",
"It is not a LoRA for a clip made here: it runs through its own action. Take it out of this clip.": "這不是用於此處片段的 LoRA：它透過自己的動作執行。請將它從這個片段移除。",
"It is rendering a job that is not this Spark's.": "它正在算不屬於這台 Spark 的工作。",
"It is rendering another job.": "它正在算另一個工作。",
"It is rendering one of this Spark's clips: cancel the job first.": "它正在算這台 Spark 的片段：請先取消該工作。",
"It is rendering: cancel its clip before restarting.": "它正在算圖：請先取消它的片段再重新啟動。",
"It is rendering: update it when its job is done.": "它正在算圖：請等工作完成後再更新。",
"It makes it in the Studio.": "它會在 Studio 中製作。",
"It may use": "它可能會使用",
"It runs on a DGX Spark or another CUDA machine with MiniMax H3 Ref2VA (bash oneshot-setup-spark.sh --swap, 2.1 GB beside Ref2VA). On a Mac the panel says it is not available.": "需在 DGX Spark 或其他搭配 MiniMax H3 Ref2VA 的 CUDA 機器上執行（bash oneshot-setup-spark.sh --swap，在 Ref2VA 之外另需 2.1 GB）。在 Mac 上面板會顯示無法使用。",
"It stopped answering:": "它停止回應：",
"It waits while that worker is busy; failures never fall back.": "該工作節點忙碌時會等待；失敗時絕不改用其他節點。",
"It works on a clip that starts from a first frame, not from references.": "它適用從首影格開始的片段，不適用從參考開始的片段。",
"Its Studio app is not running: “Update and start” starts it.": "它的 Studio 應用程式未執行：按「更新並啟動」即可啟動。",
"Its Studio code no longer matches this Spark's: “Update and start” brings it level.": "它的 Studio 程式碼已與這台 Spark 不一致：按「更新並啟動」即可同步。",
"Its access key": "它的存取金鑰",
"Its address as you would type it after ssh. It needs the Studio installed once (oneshot-setup-spark.sh, with the FastH3 models); “Update and start” then sends": "輸入你在 ssh 後面會打的位址。那台機器需先安裝過一次 Studio（oneshot-setup-spark.sh，含 FastH3 模型）；之後「更新並啟動」會傳送",
"Its agents now run there: connect each one, and the studio installs, signs in and checks it over SSH.": "它的助理現在在那裡執行：逐一連接，工作室會透過 SSH 安裝、登入並檢查。",
"Its app asks for its access key, which could not be read over ssh from its studio folder (the file access-key there): check that file, then Check again.": "它的應用程式要求存取金鑰，但無法透過 ssh 從它的 studio 資料夾讀取（該處的 access-key 檔案）：請檢查該檔案，再按「重新檢查」。",
"Its app could not be started:": "它的應用程式無法啟動：",
"Its app does not answer through the tunnel:": "它的應用程式沒有透過通道回應：",
"Its author approves each download on Hugging Face. Ask once; the studio installs it by itself when they say yes.": "每次下載都需作者在 Hugging Face 上核准。申請一次即可；作者同意後，工作室會自動安裝。",
"Its code or memory guard differs; stop it and start it again.": "它的程式碼或記憶體防護不同；請停止後再重新啟動。",
"Its identity changed or it is rendering another job; it is left running.": "它的身分已變更，或正在算另一個工作；維持執行。",
"Its job id, or a clip's path": "它的工作 id，或片段路徑",
"Its key fingerprint:": "金鑰指紋：",
"Its own workflow": "它自己的工作流程",
"Its owned local Studio process is not running; Start explicitly to use this GPU.": "它由 Studio 管理的本機程序未執行；要使用這張 GPU 請手動啟動。",
"Its speech is transcribed on this machine the first time (faster-whisper or whisper), and the words are kept beside the clip for next time.": "第一次會在這台機器上轉錄語音（faster-whisper 或 whisper），文字會存放在片段旁，下次直接使用。",
"JPEG and WebP only.": "僅限 JPEG 與 WebP。",
