"Kling 3.0": "Kling 3.0",
"Kling 3.0 advertises a 3-15s range while API documentation shows discrete 5/10 values; the two claims conflict.": "Kling 3.0 宣稱支援 3-15 秒，但 API 文件只列出 5/10 兩個值；兩者說法衝突。",
"Kling 3.0 launched February 4, 2026 (confirmed via Kuaishou investor relations), with a faster Kling 3.0 Turbo variant following June 17, 2026. It generates synchronized video and audio in one pass with multi-language lip sync. Kling's own API documentation was unreachable, so parameter names and ranges were corroborated across multiple API integrators rather than the primary source. The 4K-at-60fps claim is third-party only, so fps is null. Max prompt length, seed support, and whether timestamped beat direction works are all unverified; the multi-shot toggle handles angle changes but is not confirmed to be timestamp-driven.": "Kling 3.0 於 2026 年 2 月 4 日推出（經快手投資人關係確認），更快的 Kling 3.0 Turbo 版本於 2026 年 6 月 17 日跟進。它在一次生成中同步產生影片與音訊，並支援多語言對嘴。Kling 自己的 API 文件無法存取，因此參數名稱與範圍是交叉比對多家 API 整合商而來，而非原始來源。4K 60fps 的說法只來自第三方，因此 fps 為 null。最大提示詞長度、種子支援，以及時間碼節拍指示是否有效都未經驗證；多鏡頭開關可處理角度變化，但未確認是否依時間碼驅動。",
