"Krea": "Krea",
"Krea 2": "Krea 2",
"Krea 2 (announced May 2026, ~12B parameters, built from scratch rather than as a FLUX fine-tune) is the current flagship, superseding Krea 1. The FLUX.1 Krea [dev] open-weights model, co-developed with Black Forest Labs, is a separate lineage sharing the same naturalistic aesthetic bias. Negative-prompt support, seed control, and guidance/step parameters are not documented anywhere Krea publishes, so those flags are set false to mean 'not exposed' rather than confirmed absent. Krea 2's resolution ceiling, full aspect-ratio list, and max prompt length are unverified; the values shown are Krea 1's confirmed figures. A realtime generation mode also exists but its parameters were not verified.": "Krea 2（2026 年 5 月發表，約 12B 參數，從零打造而非 FLUX 微調）是目前的旗艦，取代 Krea 1。與 Black Forest Labs 共同開發的 FLUX.1 Krea [dev] 開放權重模型是另一條系譜，具有相同的自然主義美學傾向。反向提示詞支援、種子控制與 guidance／步數參數在 Krea 公開的資料中都沒有記載，因此這些旗標設為 false，表示「未開放」而非確認不存在。Krea 2 的解析度上限、完整畫面比例清單與最大提示詞長度未經驗證；顯示的數值是 Krea 1 已確認的數據。另有即時生成模式，但其參數未經驗證。",
"Krea 2 Raw": "Krea 2 Raw",
"Krea 2 Turbo": "Krea 2 Turbo",
"Kuaishou": "Kuaishou",
"Kung fu": "功夫",
"Kung fu and wushu moves with weight behind them: punches, kicks, spins, staff work.": "有份量的功夫與武術動作：拳、腿、旋身、棍法。",
"LTX-2 shipped January 6, 2026 as the first production-ready open-weights model combining 4K output, synchronized audio and open training code; LTX-2.3 is the current 22B-parameter checkpoint update, whose exact release date is unverified. Duration figures conflict across sources: audio-synced generation is documented around 10 seconds while third-party guides claim 6-20s or longer for the older non-audio pipeline, so maxDurationSec uses the conservative verified figure and durations is null. The frequently cited 50fps ceiling could not be confirmed against Lightricks' own material, so fps is null. Negative-prompt support is not mentioned in any official material and is set false meaning 'not documented'. Aspect ratios are inferred from the documented 1920x1080 and 1080x1920 outputs rather than from a published list.": "LTX-2 於 2026 年 1 月 6 日推出，是第一個結合 4K 輸出、同步音訊與開放訓練程式碼的正式可用開放權重模型；LTX-2.3 是目前的 22B 參數檢查點更新，確切發布日期未經驗證。各來源的長度數據互相衝突：音訊同步生成的文件記載約 10 秒，而第三方指南宣稱舊版無音訊流程可達 6-20 秒以上，因此 maxDurationSec 採用保守的已驗證數值，durations 為 null。常被引用的 50fps 上限無法在 Lightricks 自己的資料中證實，因此 fps 為 null。官方資料都沒有提到反向提示詞支援，設為 false 表示「未記載」。畫面比例是由文件記載的 1920x1080 與 1080x1920 輸出推得，而非來自公開清單。",
