"Make this clip larger and sharper (the Library's Upscale): the take itself is kept": "讓這個片段更大更清晰（素材庫的「放大」）：原鏡次會保留",
"Make this clip larger and sharper: a latent upscale, then one light re-draw guided by the clip itself": "讓這個片段更大更銳利：先做 latent 放大，再依片段本身輕度重繪一次",
"Makes a finished clip larger: the model’s latent upscaler enlarges it, then one light re-draw in tiles puts detail back, guided by the clip itself so it restores what is there. Mouths, motion and the clip’s own sound stay.": "把完成的片段放大：先用模型的 latent 放大器放大，再分塊輕度重繪一次補回細節，並以片段本身為依據，只還原原有的內容。嘴型、動作與片段原本的聲音都會保留。",
"Makes this clip again in a new look, in three steps. 1: the clip’s first frame is redrawn in that look by the picture model. 2: Motion Previs reads the clip’s motion as a depth layer. 3: the clip is made again from the depth layer and the redrawn frame: the motion, camera and timing come from the clip’s depth, the look and the setting from the new frame. The whole frame is redrawn, so small details can change. At most 15 seconds: a longer clip is cut to its first 15. Needs MiniMax H3 Ref2VA, Motion Previs and a picture model.": "以新風格重新製作此片段，分三步驟。1：圖片模型以該風格重繪片段的首影格。2：Motion Previs 將片段的動作讀取為深度圖層。3：以深度圖層和重繪的影格重新製作片段：動作、運鏡與節奏來自片段的深度，風格與場景來自新影格。整個畫面都會重繪，小細節可能改變。最長 15 秒：較長的片段會截取前 15 秒。需要 MiniMax H3 Ref2VA、Motion Previs 和圖片模型。",
