"MiniMax H3 speaks in the same pass as the picture. A voice sheet becomes the voice description of a spoken line; link it to a character and that character's lines use it. “Cast voice” speaks the sheet's sample line with Fish Audio Drama 3 (built with Fish Audio); the take (or a voice kept from a take of a shot) is then the speaker's reference audio in shots whose dialogue is voiced by Drama 3 (set in the Bible, or per shot).": "MiniMax H3 會在同一次推算中同時產生聲音與畫面。聲音設定表會成為台詞的聲音描述；把它連結到角色後，該角色的台詞就會使用它。「角色聲音」會用 Fish Audio Drama 3（built with Fish Audio）說出設定表的範例台詞；之後該鏡次（或從鏡頭鏡次保留的聲音）就會成為說話者在 Drama 3 配音鏡頭中的參考音訊（在設定集或逐鏡頭設定）。",
