"Model snapshot gpt-image-2-2026-04-21, released April 2026. Max prompt length is not published by OpenAI, so maxChars is null rather than guessed. There is no settable seed input (a seed appears in response metadata only) and no negative-prompt parameter, so exclusions must be written into the prompt. Reference images go through the images.edit endpoint and are locked to high input fidelity. API access requires organization verification.": "模型快照 gpt-image-2-2026-04-21，2026 年 4 月發布。OpenAI 未公開最大提示詞長度，因此 maxChars 為 null 而非臆測。沒有可設定的種子輸入（種子只出現在回應的中繼資料中），也沒有反向提示詞參數，因此排除項目必須寫進提示詞。參考圖透過 images.edit 端點傳入，並鎖定為高輸入保真度。API 存取需要組織驗證。",
