"Most LoRAs take a strength between about 0.3 and 1.2. A slider LoRA, such as Anime Slider, also takes minus values: plus leans one way (2D anime), minus the other (photographic). The Strength box of a picked LoRA shows its author's range.": "多數 LoRA 的強度約在 0.3 到 1.2 之間。滑桿型 LoRA（例如 Anime Slider）也接受負值：正值偏向一邊（2D 動畫），負值偏向另一邊（寫實攝影）。所選 LoRA 的「強度」欄會顯示作者建議的範圍。",
