"Native Windows (CUDA): video, pictures, songs, voice, sound effects and foley, the Library's actions, Character Swap, LoRA training, Tesseract Finish and the Bolt brain run on this machine through ComfyUI and TensorFold's Windows engines, each once its part is installed. Not native: DGX Spark workers (this machine renders alone).": "原生 Windows（CUDA）：影片、圖片、歌曲、配音、音效與擬音、素材庫動作、換角、LoRA 訓練、Tesseract Finish 和 Bolt 大腦，在各部分安裝後，透過 ComfyUI 與 TensorFold 的 Windows 引擎在此機器上執行。非原生：DGX Spark 工作節點（此機器單獨生成）。",
"Native Windows uses its configured model folders. Use the PowerShell setup command shown in Models & weights; automatic linking/install is not available here.": "原生 Windows 使用其設定的模型資料夾。請使用「模型與權重」中顯示的 PowerShell 安裝指令；這裡不支援自動連結或安裝。",
"Native Windows: each feature selects its installed backend. Machine > Feature checks explains model choices, verification and memory requirements. Draft fallbacks are labelled; prerequisites and live memory guards always apply.": "原生 Windows：每項功能會選用已安裝的後端。「機器 > 功能檢查」說明模型選擇、驗證與記憶體需求。草稿備援會加上標示；前置條件與即時記憶體防護一律適用。",
"Native stereo generated jointly with picture — dialogue, effects and music come out of the same pass. No silent mode is documented and there is no audio toggle in the API.": "原生立體聲與畫面同時生成：對白、音效與音樂都在同一次生成中產出。文件沒有記載靜音模式，API 也沒有音訊開關。",
"Native synchronized audio is produced with every clip; no silent mode is documented. Multilingual dialogue is supported — declare the language in the prompt.": "每個片段都會產生原生同步音訊；文件沒有記載靜音模式。支援多語言對白，請在提示詞中註明語言。",
