"Nothing here yet. Add a": "這裡還沒有內容。新增一個",
"Nothing is erased: the files go to the trash folder, and “Undo” in the message, or “Restore last deletion” in the Library, puts the last deletion back. A clip that is in a film (a project's timeline, a Slate take) stays where it is.": "不會永久刪除任何東西：檔案會移到垃圾桶資料夾，訊息中的「復原」或素材庫中的「還原上次刪除」可以把上次刪除的項目放回。已用在影片中的片段（專案時間軸、場記板鏡次）會留在原處。",
"Nothing is moved or downloaded.": "不會移動或下載任何東西。",
"Nothing is moved, copied or downloaded: a file found elsewhere is linked where the studio looks for it (a symlink, or a recorded link when that folder cannot be written).": "不會移動、複製或下載任何東西：在其他位置找到的檔案會連結到工作室尋找的位置（使用符號連結，資料夾無法寫入時則記錄連結）。",
