"Nothing to deliver yet: add a scene and shots first.": "還沒有可交付的內容：請先新增場景與鏡頭。",
"Nothing to do: a browser on the computer running the studio (localhost) never needs the key, and neither do updates there.": "不需要做任何事：在執行工作室的電腦上的瀏覽器（localhost）永遠不需要金鑰，在那裡更新也不需要。",
