"Pick the agent you already use. Say what you want; it works through the Studio and asks when a choice matters. Describe the shot, the scene or the whole film.": "選你已經在用的助理。說出你想要的，它會透過 Studio 完成，遇到重要選擇時會詢問你。可以描述鏡頭、場景或整部影片。",
