"Presets & preferences": "預設與偏好",
"Press Connect: the studio finds the agent (or installs it), runs its own sign-in, checks it answers and makes it your default. It keeps nothing of the sign-in; each answer is billed to your own subscription.": "按下「連接」：工作室會找到助理（或安裝它）、執行它自己的登入、確認能回應，並設為你的預設。工作室不保留任何登入資訊；每次回應都由你自己的訂閱計費。",
"Press Remove a person under a clip in the Library: the person is found from a few words (SAM 3.1), painted green, and removed in windows of 22 frames through Akatz Labs' H3 Relay.": "在素材庫的片段下方按「移除人物」：用幾個字找出人物（SAM 3.1），塗成綠色，再透過 Akatz Labs 的 H3 Relay 以每 22 影格為一窗移除。",
"Press Turnaround under a picture in the Library: one picture in, five views of its subject out, each a picture of its own.": "在素材庫的圖片下方按「轉面」：放入一張圖片，產生主體的五個視角，每個視角都是一張獨立圖片。",
"Press Upscale under a clip in the Library: the latent upscaler enlarges the clip, then one light re-draw in tiles is guided by the clip itself through this LoRA (dntpi's H3 Video Upsampler).": "在素材庫的片段下方按「放大」：latent 放大器先放大片段，再由這個 LoRA 以片段本身引導分塊輕度重繪（dntpi 的 H3 Video Upsampler）。",
