"Prompt": "提示詞",
"Prompt shape: '<mva> front-right quarter view, eye-level shot'; the camera ring writes it. v2, step 1500, is the file the author recommends. Trained on single objects and characters: side and back views often come back on a plain background. Lower the strength towards 0.8 if a result copies your picture. A picture of a whole scene is often reduced to one thing in it on a plain background (measured on both machines). Measured here on Turbo's 8 steps: the quarter views turn the way asked, but a straight left side view and a straight right side view can come out facing the same way. The author's own setting is 40 steps on the base model (the installers' --image-edit adds it; not measured here).": "提示詞格式：'<mva> front-right quarter view, eye-level shot'；攝影機角度環會幫你寫。作者推薦的檔案是 v2、step 1500。以單一物件和角色訓練：側面和背面常會變成素色背景。如果結果複製了你的圖片，把強度往 0.8 調低。整個場景的圖片常會被簡化成其中一樣東西放在素色背景上（兩台機器都量測過）。在這裡用 Turbo 的 8 步量測：四分之三側視角會照要求轉向，但正左側和正右側視角可能朝同一個方向。作者自己的設定是基礎模型 40 步（安裝程式的 --image-edit 會加上；這裡沒有量測）。",
"Prompt · Subject, Composition, Lighting, Camera, Style, Mood": "提示詞 · 主體、構圖、燈光、攝影機、風格、氛圍",
"Prompt-to-picture": "提示詞轉圖片",
