"Provide a connective beat, such as a clock, phone, or signal, that ties both locations to the same moment in time.": "提供一個串接節拍，例如時鐘、手機或訊號，把兩個地點綁在同一個時間點。",
"Provide a full rear view, useful for anonymity, mystery, or POV setups.": "提供完整的背面視角，適用於隱匿身分、神秘感或主觀鏡頭的鋪陳。",
"Pull back from the dancer's final pose to reveal the complete performance space, landing on a settled closing frame.": "從舞者的最後姿勢拉遠，揭示完整的表演空間，落在穩定的收尾畫面。",
"Pull back to show the subject's path within the full scale of the environment.": "拉遠，呈現主體在整個環境尺度中的路徑。",
"Pull the camera back out to a wide, settled frame that shows where characters land once the scene's conflict resolves.": "把攝影機拉回寬廣、穩定的畫面，呈現場景衝突解決後角色落在何處。",
"Pull-Back Reveal": "後拉揭示",
