"Random": "隨機",
"Ranges are observed recipe peaks, not minimum requirements. GPU usage includes other apps. + means a memory-limited run ended before completion; the full-run peak may be higher. GPU, host, unified and commitment pools overlap; do not add them.": "範圍是觀測到的配方峰值，不是最低需求。GPU 使用量包含其他應用程式。+ 表示受記憶體限制的執行在完成前結束；完整執行的峰值可能更高。GPU、主機、統一記憶體與承諾記憶體池彼此重疊，請勿相加。",
