"Ratio list confirmed for Krea 1; Krea 2's full list was not published.": "比例清單已在 Krea 1 確認；Krea 2 的完整清單尚未公布。",
"Re-draw": "重繪",
"Re-verified August 4, 2026. Platform API facts (params, limits, file caps) from platform.minimax.io as before. Prompt grammar replaced with MiniMax's official H3 prompt-writing guides published with the open weights: huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3 docs/VIDEO_PROMPT_WRITING_GUIDE_base_en.md (three-field format, [Shot N] markers with MM:SS.SSS timestamps, camera vocabulary with amplitude/speed, (Sx) speakers, <d>[Language]</d> dialogue, <scenetrans>/<cutoff>, task-type instruction lines for I2VA/FL2VA/L2VA) and docs/VIDEO_PROMPT_WRITING_GUIDE_ref_en.md (<Subject/Picture/Video/Audio N> labels, bracketed task-type summary, retention_analysis markers). These supersede the earlier 'no shot-marker syntax documented' finding — timecodeBeats is now true and beat sheets compile to shot markers. Output fps set to 24 per the model card. Seed and negative-prompt support remain undocumented — false means 'do not rely on it'. The model card states 4-15s duration, up to 2K (default short side 768), 32 kHz stereo audio, and stable dialogue in 11 languages.": "2026 年 8 月 4 日重新核實。平台 API 資訊（參數、限制、檔案上限）一樣取自 platform.minimax.io。提示詞語法改依 MiniMax 隨開放權重發布的官方 H3 提示詞撰寫指南：huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3 docs/VIDEO_PROMPT_WRITING_GUIDE_base_en.md（三欄格式、附 MM:SS.SSS 時間碼的 [Shot N] 標記、含幅度／速度的運鏡詞彙、(Sx) 說話者、<d>[Language]</d> 對白、<scenetrans>/<cutoff>、I2VA/FL2VA/L2VA 的任務類型指令行）以及 docs/VIDEO_PROMPT_WRITING_GUIDE_ref_en.md（<Subject/Picture/Video/Audio N> 標籤、括號內的任務類型摘要、retention_analysis 標記）。這些取代了先前「無文件記載的鏡頭標記語法」的結論——timecodeBeats 現為 true，節拍表會編譯成鏡頭標記。依模型卡將輸出 fps 設為 24。種子與反向提示詞的支援仍無文件記載——false 代表「不要依賴」。模型卡載明時長 4-15s、最高 2K（預設短邊 768）、32 kHz 立體聲音訊，並支援 11 種語言的穩定對白。",
