"Required multimodal array. Each element has a type — text, image_url, video_url, audio_url — and an optional role: first_frame, last_frame, reference_image, reference_video, reference_audio, base_video. Exactly one non-empty text item is mandatory; frame roles and reference roles cannot be mixed in one request.": "必填的多模態陣列。每個元素有一個 type——text、image_url、video_url、audio_url——以及選用的 role：first_frame、last_frame、reference_image、reference_video、reference_audio、base_video。必須剛好有一個非空的 text 項目；同一次請求中不能混用影格角色與參考角色。",
