"SUNSET WARNING: OpenAI discontinued the Sora web and mobile apps on April 26, 2026, and notified developers that the Videos API and every sora-2 model snapshot will be removed from the API on September 24, 2026, with no replacement named. Any workflow targeting Sora should be treated as short-lived. Sora 2 itself shipped in late September 2025 and remains the current and final version — there is no Sora 3. Max prompt length and output fps are not published, so both are null. Up to 2 uploaded character references (2-4s reference clips) are supported per generation. There is no seed parameter and no structured camera-control parameter; camera direction is prompt text only.": "停止服務警告：OpenAI 已於 2026 年 4 月 26 日停止 Sora 網頁版與行動 App，並通知開發者 Videos API 及所有 sora-2 模型快照將於 2026 年 9 月 24 日自 API 移除，未指定替代方案。任何以 Sora 為目標的工作流程都應視為短期使用。Sora 2 本身於 2025 年 9 月下旬推出，仍是目前也是最後的版本——沒有 Sora 3。最大提示詞長度與輸出 fps 均未公布，因此皆為 null。每次生成最多支援 2 個上傳的角色參考（2-4s 參考片段）。沒有種子參數，也沒有結構化的運鏡參數；運鏡只能寫在提示詞文字裡。",
"Sam Wasserman and Wasserman Productions: helped design and build the studio in collaboration with Keys; Wasserman's Filmmaker Suite (ScriptBreak, Cork Board, Master Canvas, Storyboard Reference Studio, Blockout, Motion Previs Studio, Slate, Circle Take, Stem Studio, Call Sheet, DaVinci MCP), the Sharp Spec, the 80s Horror LoRA and the studio's art; More local agents and the memory guard's cold-load fix": "Sam Wasserman 與 Wasserman Productions：與 Keys 合作設計並打造本工作室；Wasserman 電影人套件（ScriptBreak、Cork Board、Master Canvas、Storyboard Reference Studio、Blockout、Motion Previs Studio、Slate、Circle Take、Stem Studio、Call Sheet、DaVinci MCP）、Sharp Spec、80s Horror LoRA 與工作室的美術；更多本機助理，以及記憶體防護的冷載入修正",
