"Slate films": "場記板影片",
"Slate is Sam Wasserman's prompt studio for AI filmmaking. Here its workflow is built into Production and wired to the render queue: you plan the film the way a crew does, and every shot renders without copying a prompt anywhere.": "場記板是 Sam Wasserman 為 AI 電影製作打造的提示詞工作室。這裡把它的工作流程內建到「製作」並串接算圖佇列：你可以像劇組一樣規劃影片，每個鏡頭都能直接算圖，不必到處複製提示詞。",
"Slate's “Import a take rendered on another machine” asks for that studio's access key beside its address: copy it from that machine's Settings → Access key.": "場記板的「匯入在另一台機器算圖的鏡次」會要求在位址旁輸入該工作室的存取金鑰：請從那台機器的「設定 → 存取金鑰」複製。",
"Slate, the Bible and portable project handoff": "場記板、設定集與可攜專案交接",
"Slate, the prompt studio for AI filmmaking, is created by Sam Wasserman (wassermanproductions.com), Apache-2.0. This tab is a port of its workflow with rendering added: the project files, coverage plans, setups and brain prompts are Slate's.": "Slate 是 AI 電影製作的提示詞工作室，由 Sam Wasserman（wassermanproductions.com）打造，採 Apache-2.0。這個分頁移植了它的工作流程並加上算圖：專案檔、鏡頭覆蓋計畫、設定組與大腦提示詞都來自 Slate。",
"Slot, in bars": "時段（小節）",
"Slot:": "時段：",
"Slow pan across a texture-rich element of the environment; this shot should feel observational, not narratively urgent.": "緩慢橫搖過環境中質感豐富的元素；這個鏡頭應是旁觀的，而非推動劇情的急迫感。",
"Slow, graceful orbit around the dancer at their movement's peak moment, built to be slowed in post for maximum visual impact.": "在舞者動作的高峰時刻緩慢、優雅地環繞，適合後製放慢以取得最大的視覺衝擊。",
"Slow-Mo Feature": "慢動作特寫",
