"Snap sudden attention onto a critical action detail or reaction.": "把注意力突然拉到關鍵的動作細節或反應上。",
"Snapshot of the film when Prepare was clicked. Prepare again after edits.": "按下「準備」時的影片快照。編輯後請再準備一次。",
