"Sound and movement": "聲音與動作",
"Sound and movement keeps the two in step: Impacts is fast strikes and blocks with their sound, Flow is slow movement that is silent or under music, and Automatic never lays hits over a reference that moves slowly. A reference is followed at its own speed, so Impacts over a slow one leaves the video out and lets the picture and the prompt carry the fight.": "「聲音與動作」讓兩者同步：打擊是快速出招與格擋並帶有聲音，流動是無聲或配樂下的緩慢動作，自動模式絕不會在動作緩慢的參考上疊加打擊聲。參考會依它自己的速度跟隨，所以在緩慢的參考上用打擊，會捨棄影片，讓圖片和提示詞撐起打鬥。",
