"Stable Audio Open is not downloaded: its page on Hugging Face is gated, so accept its licence there (huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-audio-open-1.0), then run `bash scripts/setup-sound.sh` again.": "Stable Audio Open 尚未下載：它在 Hugging Face 的頁面需申請存取，請先在該頁接受授權（huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-audio-open-1.0），再執行一次 `bash scripts/setup-sound.sh`。",
