"Stay directly behind the subject to build urgency and put the viewer in pursuit.": "緊跟在主體正後方，製造急迫感，讓觀眾置身追逐之中。",
"Stay well behind the subject with obstructions and crowd cover between camera and target, holding a cautious following distance.": "遠遠跟在主體後方，攝影機與目標之間有障礙物與人群掩護，保持謹慎的跟隨距離。",
