"Step": "步驟",
"Step 2 also takes up to": "步驟 2 最多還可放",
"Step 2 has a second slot under the first frame: Last frame. The clip ends on that picture. The model holds it as its end keyframe, exactly as it holds a first frame as the start.": "步驟 2 在首影格下方還有第二個欄位：尾影格。片段會停在那張圖片上。模型把它當成結尾關鍵影格，就像把首影格當成開頭一樣。",
"Step 2 shows the image prompt, copied from your scene box. Set how many, press “Make scouts”, and click the one you want. Scouts are made at the size the video starts from.": "步驟 2 顯示從場景欄複製過來的圖片提示詞。設定張數，按「生成勘景圖」，再點選你要的那張。勘景圖會以影片起始的尺寸生成。",
"Step 3 holds everything you hear. “+ Add a line” gives a character something to say; Soundscape describes the background sound. Leave the lines empty for a clip with no speech.": "步驟 3 放所有聽得到的東西。「+ 新增台詞」讓角色說話；環境音景描述背景聲。片段沒有台詞就把台詞留空。",
"Step 4 shows the exact text the video model receives, built from steps 1 to 3. You can edit it by hand.": "步驟 4 顯示影片模型實際收到的文字，由步驟 1 到 3 組成。你可以手動修改。",
"Step 4 then opens the prompt with a line that places Picture 1 at the start and Picture 2 at the end. Keep that line.": "步驟 4 接著會在提示詞開頭加一行，把圖片 1 放在開頭、圖片 2 放在結尾。請保留這一行。",
"Step 5 shows the settings in one line and a time estimate. “Queue this clip” sends it to the render bay along the bottom, which shows the time left.": "步驟 5 用一行顯示設定並估計時間。「加入佇列」會把片段送到底部的算圖區，那裡會顯示剩餘時間。",
"Steps": "步數",
"Steps reported by hosting providers, plus an auto setting that lets the model pick. 20s is the single-generation ceiling; go longer by chaining clips.": "步數取自託管供應商，另有讓模型自行決定的 auto 設定。單次生成上限為 20s；要更長就串接片段。",
