"Takes one person out of a clip and draws the background again. The person is found from a few words and followed through the clip; the removal then runs in overlapping windows of 22 frames. The whole picture is drawn again, so small details outside the person can change too. Best on a short continuous shot.": "把一個人從片段中移除並重新繪製背景。系統會依幾個字的描述找出這個人並在整個片段中追蹤；移除則以 22 影格的重疊視窗執行。整個畫面都會重繪，因此人物以外的小細節也可能改變。最適合短的連續鏡頭。",
