"That computer's host key has changed since it was last seen. If it was reinstalled, remove its old line from ~/.ssh/known_hosts here (`ssh-keygen -R": "那台電腦的主機金鑰自上次連線後已變更。若它重新安裝過，請從這裡的 ~/.ssh/known_hosts 移除它的舊紀錄（`ssh-keygen -R",
