"That size/count has not been verified. Choose a checked recipe or check the next level in Machine.": "這個尺寸／數量尚未驗證。請選擇已驗證的配方，或到「機器」檢查下一級。",
"That was the last lesson": "這是最後一課了",
"The": "此",
"The Bible holds the logline, the world and tone, and how the film renders (resolution, quality). Studios holds the sheets: Casting, Art Department, Locations, Lookbook. Describe something in one line and ✦ Fill writes the sheet.": "設定集 收錄一句話故事、世界觀與調性，以及影片的算圖方式（解析度、畫質）。Studios 收錄各張設定表：選角、美術、場景、風格手冊。用一行描述某樣東西，✦ 填寫就會寫好那張表。",
"The CLI did not say it signed out": "CLI 沒有表示已登出",
