"This installation has its own commits. Updates will keep them; merge them manually first.": "這個安裝有自己的 commit。更新會保留它們；請先手動合併。",
"This is": "這是",
"This is Tesseract Converter's own Windows release, which cannot write a Premiere Pro project that links an After Effects composition (titles, captions and resized clips need one). Run `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\setup-windows-finish.ps1`: it builds the converter with that fixed (about 3 minutes). The After Effects project and the FCPXML work meanwhile.": "這是 Tesseract Converter 官方的 Windows 版，無法輸出連結 After Effects 合成的 Premiere Pro 專案（片名、字幕與調整尺寸的片段都需要）。請執行 `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts\\setup-windows-finish.ps1`：它會建置已修正此問題的轉換器（約 3 分鐘）。在此期間 After Effects 專案與 FCPXML 都可正常使用。",
"This lesson takes one idea all the way to a finished video file without leaving the app. Open Story → Film, pick “Wasserman Slate”, type a name for the film and press “Create”.": "這堂課帶一個點子一路做到完成的影片檔，全程不離開應用程式。開啟「故事 → 影片」，選「Wasserman Slate」，輸入影片名稱，然後按「建立」。",
