"This shot has a slot in bars and the film has no song: set the tempo in the Bible, or the shot renders at its seconds.": "這個鏡頭以小節設定區段，但影片沒有歌曲：請在設定集中設定速度，否則鏡頭會依秒數生成。",
"This shot has no sectioned prompt for the brain to revise: write one, or clear the notes to regenerate at a new seed": "這個鏡頭沒有可讓大腦修改的分段提示詞：請寫一份，或清除備註以用新種子重新生成",
