"This timeline and its clips for DaVinci Resolve: unzip, then File › Import › Timeline (the folder is set under Write › Bring in)": "這條時間軸及其片段，供 DaVinci Resolve 使用：解壓縮後，到 File › Import › Timeline（資料夾在「寫入 › 匯入」中設定）",
"This tool is turned off.": "這個工具已關閉。",
"This update also changes installation dependencies: in the studio's folder run `git pull && bash oneshot-setup.sh --upgrade`, then restart the studio.": "這次更新也會變更安裝相依套件：請在 studio 資料夾執行 `git pull && bash oneshot-setup.sh --upgrade`，然後重新啟動 studio。",
"This video is chosen: open “Use as soundtrack” under a song": "已選取這部影片：在歌曲下方開啟「用作配樂」",
"Three LoRAs do one job on a clip made from references, and the row of a picked one says what it needs and whether the clip has it. Character Swap: your clip as Video 1 and a picture of the new character; under Video 1 say who is replaced. Lineart Anime: a line-art video as Video 1; “Make line art of Video 1” draws one from any clip (white lines on black), and Scene and Action describe the finished picture. Keyframe Animation: one or two drawings as pictures, at 20 passes.": "三個 LoRA 各在以參考圖生成的片段上負責一件事，選取後該列會說明需要什麼、片段是否具備。Character Swap：你的片段作為影片 1，加上新角色的圖片；在影片 1 底下說明要替換誰。Lineart Anime：線稿影片作為影片 1；「把影片 1 做成線稿」可從任何片段畫出一份（黑底白線），場景與動作欄描述完成後的畫面。Keyframe Animation：一或兩張畫作為圖片，用 20 步。",
"Three adapters, 1.9 GB each: hero (1 drawing), tween (2 drawings), sequence (2 drawings); this preset is sequence. Works on a clip from references with one or two drawings as pictures, at 20 passes (the author: not on a Turbo adapter).": "三個轉接器，各 1.9 GB：hero（1 張原畫）、tween（2 張原畫）、sequence（2 張原畫）；這個預設是 sequence。用在以參考圖生成的片段上，放入一兩張原畫作為圖片，20 步（作者說明：不適用 Turbo 轉接器）。",
"Thriller": "驚悚",
