"Through-Object Framing": "穿透物件構圖",
"Through-Obstruction": "穿透遮擋",
"Through: a Spark this Mac reaches by ssh and that reaches the other Spark by its own key login (the Spark that leads them, e.g. user@spark-head); leave it empty when this Mac reaches the Spark itself.": "經由：這台 Mac 能用 ssh 連到、且能用自己的金鑰登入另一台 Spark 的那台 Spark（帶領它們的那台，例如 user@spark-head）；這台 Mac 能直接連到該 Spark 時請留空。",
