"Ticked takes can be deleted together or sent to Finish.": "勾選的鏡次可以一起刪除或送到「完成」。",
"Ticked, it goes into shots that open on cast stills as that speaker's reference audio, so the voice stays the same from shot to shot. “Cast again (next seed)” makes another take; a take over 15 seconds needs “Cut to 15 s”.": "勾選後，它會在以角色定裝照開場的鏡頭中作為該說話者的參考音訊，讓聲音在各鏡頭間保持一致。「再選一次（下一個種子）」會再生成一個鏡次；超過 15 秒的鏡次需要「裁到 15 秒」。",
"Ticked, “Have Whisper listen for the lyrics after” gives a rough score: sung words are harder to hear than spoken ones.": "勾選「完成後讓 Whisper 聽寫歌詞」會給出粗略分數：唱出的字比說出的字難辨識。",
"Tight frame on feet striking the floor or hands articulating a gesture, timed to the beat for rhythmic editorial cutting.": "緊湊拍攝腳踩地板或手部比出手勢，對準節拍，方便有節奏地剪接。",
"Tight insert on the critical action in A, such as a countdown, a lock, or hands working, timed to feel urgent.": "緊湊插入 A 中的關鍵動作，例如倒數、鎖或工作中的雙手，時間安排要有急迫感。",
"Tight insert on the hand, prop, or object central to the character's entrance, such as a weapon, gift, badge, or key detail.": "緊湊插入角色登場時的關鍵手部、道具或物件，例如武器、禮物、徽章或重要細節。",
"Tight insert on the precise trigger, such as a note, a sound source, or an arriving object, that the rest of the scene will react to.": "緊湊插入確切的觸發物，例如紙條、聲源或到來的物件，讓場景其餘部分對它做出反應。",
"Tight low frame on debris, dust, or damage settling in the immediate aftermath of the impact.": "在衝擊剛結束時，以低角度緊湊拍攝碎片、塵埃或落定的損毀。",
"Tight, fast-shutter-feeling frame on the point of contact driving the motion, such as footfall, tires, or gripping hands.": "以帶高速快門感的緊湊畫面拍攝驅動動作的接觸點，例如腳步、輪胎或緊握的手。",
"Tight, legible frame on the specific detail, such as a street sign, door number, or plaque, that answers where we are.": "以清楚可辨的緊湊畫面拍攝特定細節，例如路牌、門牌或銘牌，回答「我們在哪裡」。",
"Tight, slightly tense framing on the key character in A; expression and breathing should signal rising pressure.": "以緊湊、略帶緊張的構圖拍攝 A 的關鍵角色；表情與呼吸應透露壓力升高。",
