"To have someone say a recording, add it as audio and write its words as the spoken line in step 3: the clip then performs the recording. With other words, also describe the voice in the line's Voice box, or little of it comes across. A video's own sound can be a reference too: tick the box under the videos.": "要讓某人說出一段錄音，把它加為音訊，並在步驟 3 把錄音內容寫成台詞：片段就會演出這段錄音。若用別的台詞，也要在該台詞的「聲音」欄描述聲音，否則幾乎沒效果。影片原聲也可以當參考：勾選影片下方的方塊。",
