"Trigger first, damage level second, then the scene: the hub writes the first two for you. Period details help: wood panelling, studio lighting, 4:3, 1980s clothes. 0.7 to 0.9 softens the wear.": "先寫觸發詞，其次是損壞程度，再寫場景：LoRA 中心會幫你寫好前兩項。年代細節有幫助：木質牆板、攝影棚燈光、4:3、1980 年代服裝。0.7 到 0.9 可減輕磨損感。",
