"Untick “Play while it is made” to have a part with missing words drawn again before you hear it: sound already played cannot be taken back.": "取消勾選「邊生成邊播放」，讓缺字的部分在你聽到之前就先重畫：已播放的聲音無法收回。",
"Unticked, this Spark is given no clips; it stays in the list": "取消勾選後，這台 Spark 不會分到片段，但仍留在清單中",
