"Unverified features need a saved pass; badges are shown.": "未驗證的功能需要已儲存的通過紀錄；徽章會顯示。",
"Unzip the timeline in that folder and import the .fcpxml: every clip opens online. Leave the folder empty to relink by hand.": "在該資料夾解壓縮時間軸並匯入 .fcpxml：每個片段都會直接上線。資料夾留空則需手動重新連結。",
"Up next": "下一個",
"Up to": "最多",
"Up to 10 image references. Early-access reports say reference adherence is still inconsistent for image-to-video.": "最多 10 張參考圖。搶先體驗回報指出，圖生影片的參考遵循度仍不穩定。",
"Up to 3 reference images; forces an 8s duration.": "最多 3 張參考圖；時長會強制為 8s。",
"Up to 3 references for style guidance; Krea 2 adds per-reference influence weights and multi-reference blending.": "最多 3 張參考圖作為風格引導；Krea 2 另外支援個別參考圖的影響權重與多參考圖融合。",
"Up to six sequential 512 × 512 storyboard drafts; the video route must separately accept this first frame.": "最多六張連續的 512 × 512 分鏡草稿；影片路線仍須另外接受這張首影格。",
"Up to six sequential drafts, with individual seeds": "最多六張連續草稿，各自的種子",
"Update": "更新",
"Update and restart": "更新並重新啟動",
"Update and start": "更新並啟動",
"Updates": "更新",
"Updates are paused on a detached checkout. Check out the branch you installed to update.": "在 detached checkout 狀態下更新會暫停。請切換到你安裝的分支再更新。",
"Updates follow": "更新追蹤",
"Updates follow the repository's default branch (": "更新追蹤儲存庫的預設分支(",
"Updates wait until your jobs and the render engine are idle. Projects, media and models stay in place.": "更新會等到你的工作與算圖引擎都閒置時進行。專案、媒體與模型都會留在原處。",
"Updating. Studio restarts when the update is in place…": "正在更新。更新就緒後 Studio 會重新啟動…",
"Upload": "上傳",
