"Upload a picture": "上傳圖片",
"Upload an image": "上傳圖片",
"Upload one, or press “Pick from the Library”. “Same as the first frame” makes the clip come back to where it started, which is what an orbit or a loop needs.": "上傳一張，或按「從素材庫挑選」。「與首影格相同」讓片段回到起點，環繞或循環鏡頭就需要這樣。",
"Upload one, pick one from the Library, or take a frame of a Library clip: its first frame, its last frame or the frame at a time you type. In the Library, “edit” on a picture opens this step on it.": "上傳一張、從素材庫挑一張，或從素材庫片段取一個影格：首影格、尾影格或你輸入的時間點的影格。在素材庫中，圖片上的「編輯」會以它開啟這個步驟。",
"Upload pictures": "上傳圖片",
"Upload stills": "上傳靜態圖",
"Upload the character's picture": "上傳角色圖片",
"Upload the first frame": "上傳首影格",
"Uploaded": "已上傳",
"Uploading…": "上傳中…",
"Upscale": "放大",
"Upscale on bundled baker fixture": "在內建烘焙師範例上放大",
"Upscale this clip": "放大這個片段",
"Upscale, titles, captions, the cut and the mix": "放大、標題、字幕、剪輯與混音",
"Upscales an existing 768P H3 result to 2K by resubmitting the original content plus one video_url item with role=base_video. Implemented as in-context regeneration by the base model rather than a separate super-resolution pass.": "重新送出原始內容並附上一個 role=base_video 的 video_url 項目，把既有的 768P H3 結果放大到 2K。實作方式是由基礎模型做情境內重新生成，而非另外跑一次超解析度。",
"Use": "使用",
"Use 20 passes": "使用 20 步",
"Use a one-time code instead": "改用一次性代碼",
"Use another renderer": "改用其他算圖節點",
"Use as Ref2VA voice reference": "作為 Ref2VA 聲音參考",
"Use as a depth-gradient normals proxy.": "作為深度梯度法線代理使用。",
"Use as a motion/foreground proxy mask.": "作為動態／前景代理遮罩使用。",
"Use as end": "用作結尾",
"Use as motion reference": "作為動態參考",
"Use as reference sound": "用作參考聲音",
"Use as soundtrack": "作為配樂",
"Use as this voice's Ref2VA reference in shots that open on cast stills": "在從角色靜態圖開場的鏡頭中，作為這個聲音的 Ref2VA 參考",
"Use everything found here (": "使用這裡找到的全部(",
"Use for composition, silhouettes, and line fidelity.": "用於構圖、輪廓與線條還原度。",
"Use for strong graphic line guidance.": "用於強烈的圖形線條引導。",
"Use frame at time": "使用指定時間的影格",
"Use heavy compression and shallow depth of field consistent with a long telephoto lens shooting from far away, unnoticed.": "使用強烈壓縮與淺景深，符合長焦望遠鏡頭從遠處不被察覺地拍攝。",
"Use in Edit a picture": "在編輯圖片中使用",
"Use in Image": "在圖片中使用",
"Use in Video": "在影片中使用",
"Use in the composer": "用於編排器",
"Use in the create wizard": "用於建立精靈",
"Use it": "使用",
"Use it alone: stacked with Combat Base V2 or Motion Continuity Repair it can turn unstable. The author says its training includes finishing moves and dismemberment, so it can produce graphic violence if the prompt asks for a kill.": "請單獨使用：與 Combat Base V2 或 Motion Continuity Repair 疊用可能不穩。作者表示訓練資料包含終結技與肢解，因此提示詞要求擊殺時可能產生血腥暴力畫面。",
"Use it when a new clip should move like an old one: the same drill with another person, the same fight in another place, or only the same camera move. A reference video without the analysis is a plain reference: the model sees the clip and nothing tells it what to keep.": "當新片段要像舊片段那樣動時使用：同樣的練習換個人、同樣的打鬥換個地方，或只要同樣的運鏡。沒有分析的參考影片只是一般參考：模型看得到片段，但沒有人告訴它要保留什麼。",
"Use its agents": "使用它的助理",
"Use its first frame": "使用首影格",
"Use its last frame": "使用尾影格",
"Use medium or high for dense text or multi-font layouts.": "文字密集或多字型版面請用 medium 或 high。",
"Use on this clip": "用在這個片段",
"Use on this picture": "用在這張圖片",
"Use pictures you have the right to use.": "請使用你有權使用的圖片。",
"Use pictures you have the right to use. A clear, front-facing, well-lit picture holds a face best.": "請使用你有權使用的圖片。清楚、正面、光線良好的圖片最能保住臉部。",
"Use reference video for timing and depth/video controls for structure when available.": "有的話，用參考影片控制時間，用深度／影片控制結構。",
"Use reference.mp4 for timing, ai_depth.mp4 or depth.mp4 for depth structure, pose_high_contrast.mp4 only when subject motion should be retained, and camera_motion.json as the camera-move authority.": "用 reference.mp4 控制時間，用 ai_depth.mp4 或 depth.mp4 控制深度結構，只有要保留主體動作時才用 pose_high_contrast.mp4，運鏡則以 camera_motion.json 為準。",
"Use separate depth and pose controls when available. Use camera-only prompt language when replacing subjects.": "有的話分別使用深度與姿勢控制。替換主體時，提示詞只描述攝影機。",
"Use the agents signed in on another computer (a Mac beside a DGX Spark, say). The studio runs them there over SSH with its own key; no password is typed or kept.": "使用在另一台電腦上登入的助理（例如 DGX Spark 旁的 Mac）。工作室會用自己的金鑰透過 SSH 在那裡執行；不需輸入也不保存任何密碼。",
"Use the author's prompt": "使用作者的提示詞",
"Use the prompt pack language to preserve camera while replacing subject and world.": "使用提示詞套件的寫法，在替換主體與世界的同時保留攝影機運動。",
"Use the reference clip for camera/timing, but phrase the prompt around new subjects and environments. Use camera-only wording when replacing the source subject.": "用參考片段控制攝影機／時間，但提示詞要圍繞新的主體與環境來寫。替換原始主體時，只用描述攝影機的字句。",
"Use the results": "使用結果",
"Use the settings qualified by this check.": "使用此次檢查認證過的設定。",
"Use the takes": "使用這些鏡次",
"Use the videos' own sound as a reference too.": "也把影片原聲當作參考。",
