"V8.2 became the default on July 24, 2026, replacing V8.1. V7 remains selectable and is the safer choice when you need full feature coverage, since some V8 reference features route through V7 internally. Midjourney's docs site blocks automated fetching, so exact numeric ranges for --stylize, --chaos, --weird, --sw, --ow and --seed were cross-referenced from secondary guides rather than the primary docs and should be treated as approximate. Max prompt length, current --quality values, standard-mode base resolution, and whether Draft Mode is available on V8.2 could not be verified and are omitted or null.": "V8.2 於 2026 年 7 月 24 日成為預設版本，取代 V8.1。V7 仍可選用，需要完整功能時是較保險的選擇，因為部分 V8 參考功能內部會轉由 V7 處理。Midjourney 文件網站會擋自動擷取，因此 --stylize、--chaos、--weird、--sw、--ow 與 --seed 的確切數值範圍是從次要指南交叉比對而來，並非原始文件，應視為近似值。最大提示詞長度、目前的 --quality 值、標準模式的基礎解析度，以及 V8.2 是否提供 Draft Mode 皆無法核實，因此省略或設為 null。",
