"Veo 3.1 is current, with fast and lite preview variants (veo-3.1-generate-preview, veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview). There is no Veo 4 — at Google I/O 2026 Google launched Gemini Omni as a separate parallel multimodal track rather than a Veo successor. The prompt limit is 1,024 tokens, confirmed on two official pages; the equivalent character count is not published, so maxChars is null. Native audio is always on for 3.1 with no documented disable flag. The negativePrompt capability is confirmed in Google's own prompting guide, though the exact camelCase parameter spelling is corroborated more strongly through API reference mirrors than a single canonical page.": "Veo 3.1 為目前版本，另有 fast 與 lite 預覽版（veo-3.1-generate-preview、veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview）。沒有 Veo 4——Google 在 Google I/O 2026 推出的 Gemini Omni 是另一條平行的多模態產品線，而非 Veo 的後繼者。提示詞上限為 1,024 tokens，已在兩個官方頁面確認；對應的字元數未公布，因此 maxChars 為 null。3.1 的原生音訊一律開啟，沒有文件記載的關閉旗標。negativePrompt 功能已在 Google 自家的提示詞指南中確認，但確切的 camelCase 參數拼法主要是透過 API 參考鏡像站佐證，而非單一正式頁面。",
