"What it does, by measurement: when the spoken line in step 3 is what the recording says, the clip performs that recording, the mouth moving in time with it. With other words, describe the voice in the line's Voice box as well (“a deep male voice”): the pitch then went to the recording's, where a recording with no description changed nothing when the voice was unlike the pictured person. It is not voice cloning.": "實測的作用：步驟 3 的台詞與錄音內容一致時，片段會演出這段錄音，嘴型跟著同步。若用別的台詞，也要在該台詞的「聲音」欄描述聲音（「低沉的男聲」）：這時音高會貼近錄音；而沒有描述的錄音，在聲音和圖中人物不像時毫無作用。這不是聲音複製。",
