"When it is done the clip plays here, with “Add to the editor timeline” and “Download”. “Back to the start, keep this setup” lets you change one thing and try again; “Start a new clip” clears the words and pictures.": "完成後片段會在這裡播放，並有「加入剪輯時間軸」和「下載」。「回到開頭，保留這組設定」讓你改一樣東西再試一次；「開始新片段」會清除文字與圖片。",
"When it is done, a notification says how many clips are ready and how many to look at. Turn notifications on in": "完成後會有通知告訴你幾個片段已就緒、幾個需要查看。開啟通知請到",
"When nothing is rendering, the local model looks at new clips and pictures so the Library can search by what is in them": "沒有算圖時，本機模型會檢視新的片段與圖片，讓素材庫能依內容搜尋",
"When the clip is done its job card says “Sound and movement: agree”, or “impact sound over slow motion” in red. It is a flag beside the clip, never a failed job.": "片段完成後，工作卡會顯示「聲音與動作：一致」，或以紅字顯示「慢動作上有打擊聲」。這只是片段旁的標記，不算工作失敗。",
"When the long video is done, step 5 has “Lay a song under it”. It opens the Music tab with this video chosen: make a song there, or pick one, press “Use as soundtrack” under it and then “Lay it under”.": "長影片完成後，步驟 5 會有「墊一首歌」。它會開啟音樂分頁並選好這部影片：在那裡做一首歌或挑一首，按歌曲下方的「用作配樂」，再按「墊在下面」。",
