"While a render runs, the guard reads the memory twenty times a second and stops the server if memory falls under the floor, falls too fast, or the kernel reports work stalled on memory. The job then fails with that reason in its error line and its Log.": "算圖期間，防護機制每秒讀取記憶體二十次，若記憶體低於下限、下降太快，或核心回報工作卡在記憶體上，就會停止伺服器。工作隨即失敗，原因會寫在錯誤行與日誌中。",
