"Your agent is working. Write the next thing; it goes when this turn ends.": "助理正在工作。寫下下一件事，會在這一輪結束時送出。",
"Your agent works through the Studio's own tools: stills, clips with sound, voice lines, songs and the timeline. When something matters (the length, the look, a voice, which take) it asks you here first.": "你的助理會透過 Studio 本身的工具工作：靜態圖、有聲片段、配音台詞、歌曲與時間軸。遇到重要選擇（長度、風格、配音、哪個鏡次）時，會先在這裡問你。",
"Your agents": "你的助理",
