"Your own": "自己的",
"Your own AI sign-ins, and the tools an agent may use.": "你自己的 AI 登入帳號，以及助理可使用的工具。",
"Your own clips or stills become a look or a character the video model can use: at least": "你自己的片段或靜態圖可以變成影片模型能用的風格或角色：至少",
