"YuE2 also knows [Interlude], reads others as the nearest of these ([Verse 2] as [Verse], [Hook] as [Chorus]), and for an instrumental writes its score from the tags alone. A note under the box says when there are no tags, or a tag the model may sing as words. “Pop example” fills both boxes.": "YuE2 也認得 [Interlude]，其他標記會當成最接近的一個（[Verse 2] 當 [Verse]、[Hook] 當 [Chorus]），純音樂則只依標記寫出樂譜。沒有標記，或有模型可能當歌詞唱出的標記時，欄位下方會提示。「流行範例」會填好兩個欄位。",
"YuE2 has no Mac build: on a Mac the Music tab makes songs with MiniMax Music 3.": "YuE2 沒有 Mac 版：在 Mac 上，音樂分頁會用 MiniMax Music 3 製作歌曲。",
"YuE2 needs an NVIDIA GPU with BF16, and this machine shows none.": "YuE2 需要支援 BF16 的 NVIDIA GPU，但這台機器沒有。",
"YuE2 never streams.": "YuE2 不支援串流播放。",
"YuE2 or MiniMax-Music3: a song from a style": "YuE2 或 MiniMax-Music3：依風格生成歌曲",
"YuE2 or MiniMax-Music3: lyrics and a style": "YuE2 或 MiniMax-Music3：歌詞與風格",
"YuE2 or MiniMax-Music3: lyrics and a style into a track": "YuE2 或 MiniMax-Music3：把歌詞與風格做成曲目",
"YuE2 or MiniMax-Music3: lyrics and a style to a song": "YuE2 或 MiniMax-Music3：歌詞加風格生成歌曲",
"YuE2 runs on Linux with an NVIDIA GPU (a DGX Spark, an RTX Pro 6000); here the Music tab uses MiniMax Music 3.": "YuE2 在搭載 NVIDIA GPU 的 Linux 上執行（DGX Spark、RTX Pro 6000）；這裡的音樂分頁使用 MiniMax Music 3。",
"YuE2 runs on this machine. Its code is Apache 2.0; its weights are CC BY-NC 4.0 with the authors' creator permission: personal users, content creators and musicians may publish, sell and license the songs they make, royalty-free; a company needs a commercial licence from the YuE2 authors; no illegal, harmful or deceptive use.": "YuE2 在這台機器上執行。其程式碼採 Apache 2.0；權重採 CC BY-NC 4.0，並附作者的創作者許可：個人使用者、內容創作者與音樂人可發布、販售及授權自己製作的歌曲，免版稅；公司須取得 YuE2 作者的商業授權；禁止非法、有害或欺騙性用途。",
"YuE2 writes the score": "YuE2 正在寫樂譜",
"YuE2: code Apache 2.0, weights CC BY-NC 4.0 with the authors' permission for creators: personal users, creators and musicians may publish, sell and license their songs, royalty-free; a company needs the authors' licence. MiniMax-Music3: its Community License, and its name in a commercial product.": "YuE2：程式碼採 Apache 2.0，權重採 CC BY-NC 4.0，並經作者授權給創作者：個人使用者、創作者與音樂人可發佈、販售並授權自己的歌曲，免版稅；公司需取得作者授權。MiniMax-Music3：採其 Community License，並須在商業產品中標示其名稱。",
"YuE2: code Apache 2.0; weights CC BY-NC 4.0 with the authors' creator permission (personal users, creators and musicians may sell their songs, royalty-free; a company needs the authors' licence)": "YuE2：程式碼 Apache 2.0；權重 CC BY-NC 4.0，附作者的創作者授權（個人使用者、創作者與音樂人可販售自己的歌曲，免版稅；公司需取得作者授權）",
