"kind is look or character": "kind 為 look 或 character",
"kind was changed from image to video on July 31, 2026. FLUX 3 launched July 23, 2026 as a multimodal image/video/audio/action model, but the only generation surface that actually exists is FLUX 3 Video (native audio, gated early access) — BFL's FLUX 3 Image early access had still not opened as of this update, so 'FLUX 3' as a target today means video with sound. For stills, target FLUX.2 rather than this profile; the previous revision of this entry described FLUX.2 limits and those have been removed to avoid implying they apply to FLUX 3. Re-checked August 4, 2026: BFL still publishes NO FLUX 3 documentation of any kind — the docs.bfl.ai index (docs.bfl.ml/llms.txt) lists no FLUX 3 page, no video endpoint and no video prompting guide, and BFL's own agent-skills repo (github.com/black-forest-labs/skills) covers FLUX.1 and FLUX.2 only. The only first-party FLUX 3 material is the launch post at bfl.ai/blog/flux-3, which names the modes, the 20s ceiling, native audio, multilingual dialogue, multi-shot via agentic chaining and 720p preliminary evaluations, but gives no prompting instructions. The guidance field therefore leans on BFL's model-family prompting guides — the component order and length tiers from docs.bfl.ai/guides/prompting_unified_building, and 'most FLUX models do not support negative prompts' plus the positive-replacement strategy from docs.bfl.ai/guides/prompting_unified_technical — which are written for FLUX.2 stills and are applied here as family conventions, not as documented FLUX 3 Video behaviour. UNVERIFIED, left null or false: max prompt length, fps, the aspect-ratio enum (the launch post says 'a broad range' and reporting spans 9:16 through 21:9, but no explicit list is published), seed support, and negative-prompt support. Booleans in features are set false where a capability is undocumented rather than confirmed absent — treat false as 'do not rely on it'. Duration, resolution and reference-count values here are cross-referenced from hosting providers and early-access reporting, and parameter names are indicative rather than exact.": "kind 已於 2026 年 7 月 31 日由 image 改為 video。FLUX 3 於 2026 年 7 月 23 日推出，定位為圖片／影片／音訊／動作多模態模型，但實際存在的生成介面只有 FLUX 3 Video（原生音訊、限搶先體驗）——截至本次更新，BFL 的 FLUX 3 Image 搶先體驗仍未開放，所以目前以「FLUX 3」為目標就是指有聲影片。靜態圖請改用 FLUX.2 而非此設定檔；此項目先前版本描述的 FLUX.2 限制已移除，以免讓人誤以為適用於 FLUX 3。2026 年 8 月 4 日重新檢查：BFL 仍未發布任何 FLUX 3 文件——docs.bfl.ai 索引（docs.bfl.ml/llms.txt）沒有 FLUX 3 頁面、沒有影片端點，也沒有影片提示詞指南，BFL 自己的 agent-skills repo（github.com/black-forest-labs/skills）只涵蓋 FLUX.1 與 FLUX.2。唯一的官方 FLUX 3 資料是 bfl.ai/blog/flux-3 的發布文，其中列出各模式、20s 上限、原生音訊、多語對白、透過代理串接的多鏡頭，以及 720p 初步評測，但沒有提示詞撰寫說明。因此 guidance 欄位參考 BFL 的模型系列提示詞指南——docs.bfl.ai/guides/prompting_unified_building 的元素順序與長度分級，以及 docs.bfl.ai/guides/prompting_unified_technical 的「多數 FLUX 模型不支援反向提示詞」與正向替代策略——這些是為 FLUX.2 靜態圖撰寫的，在此作為系列慣例套用，並非 FLUX 3 Video 有文件記載的行為。未經核實、設為 null 或 false：最大提示詞長度、fps、長寬比列舉（發布文說「範圍很廣」，報導涵蓋 9:16 到 21:9，但沒有公布明確清單）、種子支援與反向提示詞支援。features 中的布林值在功能無文件記載（而非確認不存在）時設為 false——false 請視為「不要依賴」。這裡的時長、解析度與參考數量是從託管供應商與搶先體驗報導交叉比對而來，參數名稱僅供參考、不保證精確。",
