"minutes after a take and is unloaded at once when a video or picture job starts. Then about 0.35 s for each second of speech, the first sound after about 0.2 s, played as it comes. The engine checks its own words with Whisper as it goes: a runaway tail is cut, and a part with missing words is drawn again (a take that was short while playing is made once more).": "分鐘，並在影片或圖片工作開始時立即卸載。之後每秒語音約需 0.35 秒，約 0.2 秒後出現第一個聲音，邊生成邊播放。引擎會邊生成邊用 Whisper 檢查自己的文字：失控的尾巴會被裁掉，缺字的部分會重繪（播放時太短的鏡次會再生成一次）。",
"minutes after a take and is unloaded at once when a video or picture job starts. Then about 0.7 s for each second of speech, the first sound after about 0.3 s, played as it comes; Whisper checks the words after.": "分鐘，並在影片或圖片工作開始時立即卸載。之後每秒語音約需 0.7 秒，約 0.3 秒後出現第一個聲音，邊生成邊播放；完成後由 Whisper 檢查文字。",
