"🗑 on a finished job deletes the job and what it made: its clip or stills, its check sheets and a first frame only it used. Tick several jobs and press “Delete selected”. “Clear failed” takes the failed jobs out of the list; “Delete all finished” takes every finished or cancelled job and its files.": "已完成工作上的 🗑 會刪除該工作及其產出：片段或靜態圖、檢查表，以及只有它用到的首影格。勾選多個工作後按「刪除所選」。「清除失敗」把失敗的工作移出清單；「刪除所有已完成」會刪除所有已完成或已取消的工作及其檔案。",
"🗑 on a tile takes the file out of the Library after you confirm. To delete several, tick them (or “Select all”) and press “Delete selected”. Deleted files are moved to the “trash” folder inside": "圖塊上的 🗑 會在你確認後把檔案移出素材庫。要刪除多個，勾選它們（或「全選」）後按「刪除所選」。刪除的檔案會移到以下位置內的「trash」資料夾：",
