"Its address as you would type it after ssh. It needs the Studio installed once (oneshot-setup-spark.sh, with the FastH3 models); “Update and start” then sends this GPU's Studio code and starts its app. No password is asked and nothing is installed as root: if ssh asks for a password, set up a key login first.": "輸入你在 ssh 後面會打的位址。那台機器要先安裝過一次 Studio（oneshot-setup-spark.sh，含 FastH3 模型）；之後按「更新並啟動」，會把這台 GPU 的 Studio 程式碼送過去並啟動它的 App。不會要求密碼，也不會以 root 安裝；如果 ssh 要你輸入密碼，請先設定金鑰登入。",
"Create lessons": "Create 課程",
"A source becomes a script, a storyboard, the characters, then their keyframes and a preproduction pack; approve it and every segment is queued.": "從原稿寫成劇本、分鏡，再做角色，接著畫關鍵影格並產出預產包；核准後每一段都會排進佇列。",
