"Sends the scenes and the shots; the characters' sheets once Characters is done, each shot's keyframe once Keyframes is done. Sending again updates the same film and keeps what was changed there. A face pinned in Cast & Places is the one Keyframes draws from.": "會送出場景和鏡頭；「角色」做完會帶上角色四面圖，「關鍵影格」做完會帶上每個鏡頭的起始圖。再送一次會更新同一部影片，你在那裡改過的會保留。在「角色與場景」釘選的角色圖，「關鍵影格」會照它畫。",
"The keyframes have not caught up with the storyboard: the film would take the old pictures. Run Keyframes first? Press OK to send it anyway.": "關鍵影格還沒跟上分鏡：影片會用到舊的圖。要先跑「關鍵影格」嗎？按「確定」直接送出。",
