"'s Studio code and starts its app. No password is asked and nothing is installed as root: if ssh asks for a password, set up a key login first. A Mac is added the same way (Remote Login on, the Studio installed with oneshot-setup.sh): while its own Studio app is open it is used as it is, and it is given a clip only when it is idle and on the same Studio version. So is a Windows PC with the native Windows Studio open and OpenSSH on (its setup's -EnableSsh): only its address is needed.": " 的 Studio 程式碼並啟動應用程式。不會要求密碼，也不會以 root 安裝任何項目；若 SSH 要求密碼，請先設定金鑰登入。Mac 的加入方式相同（開啟遠端登入，並用 oneshot-setup.sh 安裝 Studio）：只要它自己的 Studio 還開著，就維持原狀，僅在閒置且 Studio 版本相同時交付片段。已開啟原生 Windows Studio 與 OpenSSH（安裝時使用 -EnableSsh）的 Windows PC 也一樣，只需提供位址。",
